 "provenance_html": "<p>Same generator and planted structure as the tab-1 cell \u201cvery strong synergy, 25 % shared\u201d (Synthegra <code>pid_controlled</code> mode, commit 0f0dadd): K = 8 latent factors, 2 shared and 3 unique per layer, 2 cross-layer interaction pairs at strength 8, additive risk, 40 features per layer, noise \u03c3 = 0.1, asymmetric unique weights, censoring 30 %. Simulated at each cohort size with 10 seeds.</p><p>Read-out 1: synergy estimated on the oracle latent blocks of each layer with the robust BROJA estimator (<code>compute_broja_pid_multidim_robust</code>: occupancy-capped clustering, 2 KMeans seeds, 60 permutations for null correction, Miller-Madow correction), target = true risk cut into 5 quantile classes. Synergy estimates are lower bounds; cohorts where the estimator finds no usable signal are recorded as 0 bits (unresolved). Points are single seeds, the band is the 2.5\u201397.5 % range.</p><p>Read-out 2: 3-fold stratified CV, held-out C-index and IBS, models as in tab 1 (best single layer, late fusion, early linear ridge Cox, early non-linear boosted survival model, best of three neural intermediate-fusion architectures \u00d7 two hidden sizes selected on validation C-index). Gains are relative to the best single layer of the same cohort.</p>"
